# An atomic batch drops a dead-lettered entry and commits the rest.
MODULE: BatchAccountingAtomicDropsEntry
TARGET: BatchAccounting
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an atomic batch treats an enforcement dead-letter as a drop
PERTURBS: RunEnforcement

--- FIND
       ELSE IF ~tStrictE
       THEN /\ Advance(val)
            /\ UNCHANGED <<outcome, refusedBy, dropped, dlq>>
       ELSE IF atomic
--- REPLACE
       ELSE IF ~tStrictE
       THEN /\ Advance(val)
            /\ UNCHANGED <<outcome, refusedBy, dropped, dlq>>
       ELSE IF FALSE
--- END
